### Manual check (as TESTING.md "graph-manager" describes)

```bash
npm run build -w graph-execution && npm run build -w graph-manager
GM_DIR=$(mktemp -d)
node -e 'require("http").createServer((q,s)=>s.end("ext "+q.url+" "+q.headers["x-gm-extension-secret"])).listen(7431,"127.0.0.1")' &
GM_EXTENSIONS=demo=http://127.0.0.1:7431 GM_EXTENSION_SECRET=s3 GM_PASSWORD=pw GM_PORT=7430 GM_DATA_DIR=$GM_DIR/data GM_WORKSPACES_DIR=$GM_DIR/ws node apps/graph-manager/dist/server/main.js &
